<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ITT Educational started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ITT Educational started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it initiated coverage of ITT Educational Services Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- expects ITT Educational to earn $0.70 a share in 1997 and $0.88 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $35 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- ITT Educational was up 1/2 to 24-3/8.</p>
</text>
